now this will be accessible via telegram. commands are
\regcard force : that sends all registration cards in a single pdf document.
\regcard event <code> : only registrayion cards of that event.
\regcard team <registration-code> : only one reg card of the provided reg code.
\regcard all : sequentially sends reg cards of each event one file per event.





